 & =\underbrace{\E\varepsilon_{t}^{2}}_{=\sigma^{2}}+2\beta_{1}\underbrace{\E{\varepsilon_{t}\varepsilon_{t-1}}}_{=0}+\beta_{1}^{2}\underbrace{\E\varepsilon_{t-1}^{2}}_{=\sigma^{2}}=\\
